                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So after trying stage 6 for the 2,897th time, I finally get into a winning position. There is only one molecule left with 2 proteins, I have both of those available, and I have the money to use them. Nice!\n\nI celebrate a little too early because of course a virulent strain appears then and adds 2 molecules to the mix. But that's ok because I have good Dr Schlinker on the team and I still haven't used him to \"solve any issue\". Victory!\n\nExcept when I click on him and try to undo the mutation, though the confirmation dialogue comes up, I can't click on it.\n\n\"Do you want to dismiss the current mutation event?\" YES! Click-click-click-click-click-click-click-click-click-click-clidammit!! The button doesn't work. Restarting the game doesn't help, and the devs have not responded to my bug report filed more than two weeks ago.\n\nSo yea, don't buy this unless you want to face game-stopping bugs, be annoyed by achievements that fail to unlock, and be ignored by devs who don't care about the mess of a game they have released.",
